 "notes": [
  "The post's 'indicates starting' marker line was mis-parsed as a card and is dropped; the starting markers themselves did not survive. Starting cards are taken from the strategy ('get out Expand the Emp. with twielek ad. on CC port district (all start)'): Cloud City: Port Town District, Twi'lek Advisor, Expand The Empire. Prepared Defenses is also in the list.",
  "No Objective. 60 cards as posted.",
  "Posted 'Oppressive Enforcement' (under Effects) dested the Special Edition Effect Oppressive Enforcement, not the Reflections III Defensive Shield; 'Kedar the Black' dested Keder The Black.",
  "Byline 'tycho \"r ead me\" 456' (signed 'Anthony') gives no full real name, so the deck is credited to the DeckTech handle with no player page."
